    <DataNode elementId="Long-chain-alcohols" textLabel="a long-chain fatty alcohol" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="17135" dataSource="ChEBI" />
      <Graphics centerX="350" centerY="680" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="SRI, caspi">Fatty alcohols are aliphatic |FRAME: Alcohols alcohols| consisting of a chain of 3 or more carbon atoms. They may be saturated or unsaturated and may be branched or unbranched. Many enzymes that act on |FRAME: Fatty-Acids &quot;fatty acids&quot;|, as well as the corresponding |FRAME: Fatty-Acyl-CoAs &quot;fatty acyl-CoAs&quot;|, |FRAME: Fatty-Alcohols alcohols|, and |FRAME: Fatty-Aldehydes aldehydes|, have evolved to recognize substrates with a limited range of chain lengths. To classify these enzymes, it is helpful to divide the substrates into smaller groups based on their chain length. The following subgroups have been defined: |FRAME: Short-Chain-Alcohols &quot;Short-chain alcohols&quot;| have 3-5 carbons in the longest chain. |FRAME: Medium-Chain-Alcohols &quot;Medium-chain alcohols&quot;| have 6-12 carbons in the longest chain. |FRAME: Long-chain-alcohols &quot;Long-chain alcohols&quot;| have 13-22 carbons in the longest chain. |FRAME: Very-Long-Chain-Alcohols &quot;Very-long-chain alcohols&quot;| have 23-27 carbons in the longest chain. |FRAME: Ultra-Long-Chain-Alcohols &quot;Ultra-long-chain alcohols&quot;| have more than 27 carbons in the longest chain.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="Long-chain-alcohols" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Seed" value="cpd11650" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Metanetx" value="MNXM185" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Chebi" value="17135" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_LigandCpd" value="C00339" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="a fatty alcohol" />
